  git:
    hash: 
    revision: 
  upmReserved: '{"changelog":"### Added\n\n- Added a built-in diff viewer for text,
    images, and serialized Unity assets, available from Pending Changes, History,
    changesets, and branches.\n- Added Unity AI Assistant integration to manage version
    control, review changes, and query repository history using natural language.\n-
    Added support for comparing two selected revisions from the History view.\n-
    Added a details panel showing move origins/destinations and deleted item information.\n-
    Added a toggle in the Changesets tab to show or hide changesets from hidden branches.\n\n###
    Changed\n\n- Raised the minimum supported Editor to Unity 6000.0 (removed support
    for Unity 2021.3 and 2022.3).\n- Moved the settings button in the Branch Explorer
    to the bottom of the panel.\n- Visually separate the edit and remove buttons
    in the attribute panel to avoid unwanted clicks.\n- Improved how version control
    operations handle unsaved scene changes while in Play Mode.\n\n### Fixed\n\n-
    Fixed the \"Choose Repository\" dialog title capitalization. (UUM-143766)\n-
    Fixed Create Workspace not refreshing the Unity Version Control and Branch Explorer
    windows. (UUM-142548)\n- Fixed buttons overlapping the tab divider in the Branch
    Explorer options when resizing tabs. (UUM-142492)\n- Fixed the blank Default
    and Result encoding dropdowns in the Unity Version Control settings. (UUM-142544)\n-
    Fixed settings not being applied after you change them.\n- Fixed meta files of
    parent folders not being included in Add operations.\n- Fixed an \"item with
    the same key has already been added\" error.\n- Fixed an inconsistent object
    error when reloading the Settings panel.\n- Fixed the attributes panel appearing
    for a checkout changeset.\n- Fixed branch diffs being outdated when opened from
    the branches view.\n- Fixed an error shown when using Diff with previous revision
    on an item that has no previous revision.\n- Fixed the Differences window staying
    open after the plugin was paused in the settings.\n- Fixed the Branch Explorer
    not updating the Inspector diffs when the window gains focus.\n- Fixed branch
    diffs being recalculated and losing the current selection when refocusing or
    resizing the Unity Version Control window.\n- Fixed the Unity Version Control
    window not opening after reinstalling the package.\n- Fixed the sign-in windows
    refreshing only when the mouse moved.\n- Fixed being unable to set up Unity Version
    Control from Project Settings > Version Control.\n- Fixed checked-out files being
    lost when exiting the Editor.\n- Fixed auto-checkout not reporting an error when
    it failed because of a lock.\n- Fixed domain-reload exception handling on Unity
    6000.5 and newer.\n- Fixed uncontrolled dialogs being shown during batchmode."}'
